 inesses. Shop\, eat\, enjoy as you discover new favorite shops in downtown
  Martinsville and beyond. Pick up a bingo card at one of the participating
  businesses and receive a stamp at each business you visit. Shop until you
  hit BINGO\, and you'll be entered to win. Keep an eye out at individual s
 tores for fun special promotions and giveaways as well!
LOCATION:Downtown Martinsville\, Martinsville\, IN
